  {
   "title": "Marina Bay Sands",
   "text": "Three 55-storey towers, each with two legs, the curved eastern leg leaning on the other, carry a 340 m SkyPark with a 146 m pool and a 66.5 m cantilever. Drawn as simplified massing on the OpenStreetMap footprints and heights.",
